# 2. Disk Layout Recommendation

Separate application, logs, and temporary files.

| Mount Point |   Size | Purpose                           |
| ----------- | -----: | --------------------------------- |
| `/`         |  50 GB | OS and system packages            |
| `/opt`      | 100 GB | Superset installation             |
| `/var/log`  |  50 GB | Application/system logs           |
| `/tmp`      |  50 GB | Temporary processing              |
| `/data`     | 250 GB | Superset assets, exports, backups |

Example:

```text
/dev/mapper/rhel-root       50G   /
/dev/mapper/rhel-opt       100G   /opt
/dev/mapper/rhel-varlog     50G   /var/log
/dev/mapper/rhel-tmp        50G   /tmp
/dev/mapper/rhel-data      250G   /data
```

