# 3. Install Required RHEL Packages

Login as root:

```bash
sudo dnf update -y
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
sudo dnf install -y \
gcc \
gcc-c++ \
make \
openssl-devel \
libffi-devel \
python3-devel \
python3-pip \
git \
curl \
wget \
postgresql-devel \
krb5-devel \
cyrus-sasl-devel
```

Verify:

```bash
python3 --version
pip3 --version
```

---

# 4. Create Superset OS User

```bash
sudo useradd \
-m \
-d /opt/superset \
-s /bin/bash \
superset
```

Set password:

```bash
sudo passwd superset
```

Create directories:

```bash
sudo mkdir -p /data/superset

sudo chown -R superset:superset /opt/superset
sudo chown -R superset:superset /data/superset
```

---

# 5. Create Python Virtual Environment

Switch user:

```bash
su - superset
```

Create venv:

```bash
python3 -m venv /opt/superset/venv
```

Activate:

```bash
source /opt/superset/venv/bin/activate
```

Upgrade packages:

```bash
pip install --upgrade pip setuptools wheel
```

---

# 6. Install Apache Superset

```bash
pip install apache-superset
```

Verify:

```bash
superset version
```

---

# 7. Install Required Database Drivers

## YugabyteDB YSQL Driver

```bash
pip install psycopg2-binary
```

## Apache Druid Driver

```bash
pip install pydruid
```

---

# 8. Configure Superset

Create:

```bash
vi /opt/superset/superset_config.py
```

Example:

```python
SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI = (
    "postgresql+psycopg2://"
    "superset_user:<password>@"
    "yb-master01.company.com:5433/"
    "superset"
)

SECRET_KEY = "generate-a-long-random-secret"

WTF_CSRF_ENABLED = True

ROW_LIMIT = 50000

SUPERSET_WEBSERVER_TIMEOUT = 300
```

---

Set environment:

```bash
vi ~/.bash_profile
```

Add:

```bash
export SUPERSET_CONFIG_PATH=/opt/superset/superset_config.py
```

Reload:

```bash
source ~/.bash_profile
```

---

# 9. Initialize Superset Metadata Database

Run:

```bash
superset db upgrade
```

Create admin:

```bash
superset fab create-admin
```

Initialize:

```bash
superset init
```

