# 10. Gunicorn Configuration

With 16 CPUs, use multiple workers.

Recommended:

```
CPU = 16

Gunicorn workers:
2 × CPU + 1

Maximum:
33 workers
```

For Superset, don't oversubscribe because each worker consumes memory.

Recommended starting point:

```
Workers: 8-12
Threads: 4
```

Create:

```bash
mkdir -p /opt/superset/config

vi /opt/superset/config/gunicorn_config.py
```

Add:

```python
bind = "0.0.0.0:8088"

workers = 12

threads = 4

worker_class = "gthread"

timeout = 300

accesslog = "/var/log/superset/access.log"

errorlog = "/var/log/superset/error.log"
```

---

# 11. Create Systemd Service

```bash
sudo vi /etc/systemd/system/superset.service
```

Contents:

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Apache Superset
After=network.target


[Service]

User=superset
Group=superset

WorkingDirectory=/opt/superset

Environment="SUPERSET_CONFIG_PATH=/opt/superset/superset_config.py"

ExecStart=/opt/superset/venv/bin/gunicorn \
-c /opt/superset/config/gunicorn_config.py \
"superset.app:create_app()"

Restart=always


[Install]

WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

---

Enable:

```bash
sudo systemctl daemon-reload

sudo systemctl enable superset

sudo systemctl start superset
```

Check:

```bash
systemctl status superset
```

