# 14. Memory Allocation Guidance

Your 64 GB RAM:

| Component        |   Memory |
| ---------------- | -------: |
| OS               |     4 GB |
| Superset workers | 24-32 GB |
| Python overhead  |     8 GB |
| Cache/temp       |     8 GB |
| Buffer           |    12 GB |

Your sizing is more than sufficient for:

* 50–100 concurrent dashboard users
* Multiple dashboards
* SQL Lab usage
* Druid queries
* Scheduled reports (if Redis/Celery added later)

